{Function:setValidChain, Visibility:public, Explanation:Writes to variable isValidChain without any access control.}
{Function:setTetherAddress, Visibility:public, Explanation:Writes to variable tetherAddress without any access control.}
{Function:changeActivate, Visibility:public, Explanation:Writes to variable isActivated without any access control.}
{Function:bytesToAddress, Visibility:private, Explanation:Uses assembly.}
